/*
  ============================================================
  CODE 3 MX7000 - GIGA DISPLAY CONTROLLER
  Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi + GIGA Display Shield
  ============================================================

  GIGA <-> NANO ESP32 UART
  -----------------------
  GIGA D1 TX  -> Nano D12 RX
  GIGA D0 RX  <- Nano D13 TX
  GIGA GND    -> Nano GND
  Baud: 38400

  ============================================================
  SCREENS
  ============================================================

  GAUGE SCREEN
    - IPR 0-100 %
    - ICP 0-4000 PSI
    - Hidden two-finger downward swipe opens Lightbar
    - Red border ONLY for:
        * simulation mode
        * truck-data timeout

  LIGHTBAR SCREEN
    Row 1:
      TRAFFIC BREAKER | INNERS | INTERMEDIATES | OUTERS | LEDS

    Row 2:
      CLOSE | TA LEFT | TA OUT | TA RIGHT | MONITOR

    - Red border ONLY for:
        * Nano communication lost
        * Mega communication lost

  SERIAL MONITOR
    - Opened only through MONITOR
    - X returns directly to Gauge screen
    - Red border ONLY for:
        * Nano communication lost
        * Mega communication lost

  ============================================================
  SECRET GESTURE
  ============================================================

  Physical DOWN = RAW X DECREASING

  Gesture:
    - requires 2 contacts to start
    - uses average raw X
    - tolerates brief contact dropouts
    - 150 ms release grace
    - 70 raw-unit downward threshold
    - no time limit

  ============================================================
  LIGHTBAR ENTRY SAFETY
  ============================================================

  After gesture opens Lightbar:

    1. Buttons locked for 1 second
    2. Original fingers must be released
    3. Release must last 150 ms
    4. Only then are buttons enabled

  ============================================================
*/


